Package: archiveserver
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: armel
Maintainer: ArcHive <to.zionsdoor@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip
Recommends: unrar | unrar-free
Description: ArcHive - Self-hosted comic/book server for ReadyNAS
 Serves ZIP/CBZ/RAR/CBR/PDF/EPUB archives to the ArcHive Android app.
 Provides LAN auto-discovery, TLS encryption, device-based authentication,
 UPnP port forwarding (IPv4/IPv6), and a web management interface.
